          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalulu bwe kaakubwa omukuzi ogwomusanvu, kaagwa ku kika eky'Abadani ng'enda dhaibwe bwe dhaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiketezo kyaibwe kyalimu ebibuga bino: Zora, Eshitaolo, Irishemeshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaalabimu, Aiyaloni, Ithala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eloni, Timuna, Ekuroni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliteke, Gibbethoni, Baalathi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehudi, Beneberaki, Gathirimmoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meyarakoni, ni Rakkoni, era n'ekiketezo ekyezungulwire Yoppa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiseera kyatuuka, ekiketezo eky'Abadani kyabanhagibwaku abazigu. Agho Abadani baaja mu kibuga Leshemu baakirumba, baakighangula era baita abantu baamu, baakyeiriza. Baatoolera okukityamamu era baakikyusa n'eriina okuva ku Leshemu baakyeta Dani eriina lya dhaadha waibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
